2Ki 25:1 , Jerusalem is besieged;
2Ki 25:4 , Zedekiah taken, his sons slain, his eyes put out;
2Ki 25:8 , Nebuzar-adan defaces the city, carries the remnant, except a few poor labourers, into captivity;
2Ki 25:13 , and spoils and carries away the treasures;
2Ki 25:18 , The nobles are slain at Riblah;
2Ki 25:22 , Gedaliah, who was over them that remained, being slain, the rest flee into Egypt;
2Ki 25:27 , Evil-merodach advances Jehoiachin in his court.
